{
  "id": "1CH.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Mambo Ya Nyakati 13",
  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi alishauriana na makamanda wa vikosi vya maelfu na vikosi vya mamia, pamoja na viongozi wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha akawaambia Waisraeli wote waliokusanyika, “Ikiwa mtakubaliana nami, na ikiwa ni mapenzi yake Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, na tufanye hivi: Tutume wajumbe waende wakawaite ndugu zetu waliobaki nchini Israeli, pamoja na makuhani na Walawi walioko katika miji yao na malisho yao, waje wajumuike pamoja nasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha twende tukalichukue sanduku la agano la Mungu wetu, maana hatukulijali wakati wa utawala wa mfalme Shauli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wote walikubaliana na pendekezo hilo kwani waliliona kuwa jambo jema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo, Daudi aliwakusanya Waisraeli wote nchini; toka kijito cha Shihori kilichoko Misri, hadi maingilio ya Hamathi ili kulileta sanduku la Mungu toka Kiriath-yearimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi, akiandamana na Waisraeli wote, akaenda hadi mjini Baala, yaani Kiriath-yearimu, nchini Yudea, ili kulichukua toka huko sanduku la Mungu linaloitwa kwa jina lake Mwenyezi-Mungu akaaye kwenye kiti chake cha enzi juu ya viumbe vyenye mabawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, wakalichukua sanduku la Mungu kutoka katika nyumba ya Abinadabu kwa gari jipya. Uza na Ahio waliliendesha gari hilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi na Waisraeli wote wakawa wanacheza kwa nguvu zao zote, mbele ya Mungu. Waliimba huku wanapiga ala za muziki zilizotengenezwa kwa mvinje: Vinubi, vinanda, matari, matoazi na tarumbeta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipofika kwenye uwanja wa kupuria nafaka wa Kidoni, Uza aliunyosha mkono wake kulishikilia sanduku la agano kwa sababu ng'ombe walijikwaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara Mwenyezi-Mungu akamkasirikia Uza kwa kulishika sanduku, akamuua. Uza akafa papo hapo mbele ya Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi alikasirika kwa sababu Mwenyezi-Mungu alimuua Uza akiwa na hasira. Kwa sababu hiyo, mahali hapo huitwa Peres-uza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Peres-uza:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania maana yake “Pigo la Uza”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hadi leo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo Daudi akamwogopa Mungu, akasema, “Sasa, nitawezaje kulichukua sanduku la Mungu nyumbani mwangu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Daudi hakulichukua sanduku mpaka mji wa Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mji wa Daudi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yaani: Yerusalemu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bali alilipeleka nyumbani kwa Obed-edomu, Mgiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanduku hilo la Mungu lilikaa huko kwa Obed-edomu kwa muda wa miezi mitatu, naye Mwenyezi-Mungu akaibariki nyumba ya Obed-edomu na mali yake yote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
